      "title": "Define project knowledge source models",
      "description": "Add typed models for registered project workspaces, source roots, source kinds (code, Markdown, text), include/exclude rules, indexing state, and content fingerprints. Validate canonical paths and duplicate source IDs.\n\n- Previous Failure Root Cause: The verification command expects a test file that does not exist yet.\n- Resolution Strategy: Create the missing test file and ensure it is included in the allowed paths.\n- Actionable Fix Instructions: 1. Create a new file named `test_ingestion_models.py` in the `tests/unit/` directory.\n2. Write a test function that verifies the functionality of the models defined in `src/brickforge/ingestion/models.py`.\n3. Ensure that the test function imports the necessary modules and uses the correct assertions to validate the models.\n4. Run the verification command again to ensure the test file is recognized and executed.\n\n- Previous Failure Root Cause: The verification command expects a test file that does not exist yet, and there are issues with the Pydantic models in the `SourceKind` class.\n- Resolution Strategy: Create the missing test file and ensure it is included in the allowed paths. Update the Pydantic models to use `@field_validator` and add a custom schema generator for `SourceKind`.\n- Actionable Fix Instructions: 1. Create a new file named `test_ingestion_models.py` in the `tests/unit/` directory.\n2. Write a test function that verifies the functionality of the models defined in `src/brickforge/ingestion/models.py`.\n3. Ensure that the test function imports the necessary modules and uses the correct assertions to validate the models.\n4. Update the `SourceKind` class to use `@field_validator` instead of `@validator`.\n5. Add a custom schema generator for `SourceKind` to handle the `str` subclass properly.\n6. Ensure all validators in `SourceRoot` and `ProjectWorkspace` are updated to use `@field_validator`.\n7. Run the verification command again to ensure the test file is recognized and ex